{"code":200,"text":"OK","success":true,"data":{"id":3530,"excludedCurrencies":null,"title":"Responsible Gaming","content":"<h4 style=\"margin-top:16px\"><strong>1. Introduction<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN is committed to upholding the highest standards of responsible gaming as mandated by the Cura&ccedil;ao Gaming Authority (CGA). This policy outlines the company&rsquo;s operational, procedural, and strategic approach to ensuring that our gaming services are safe, fair, transparent, and designed to minimize gambling-related harm.<br \/>\nThis Responsible Gaming Policy forms an integral part of BETSSEN&rsquo;s Terms &amp; Conditions and is accessible through the homepage and footer. It applies to all brands and domains operating under BETSSEN&rsquo;s Cura&ccedil;ao license.<br \/>\nBETSSEN strictly prohibits the offering of credit for gambling activities in all forms.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>2. Core Principles<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN&rsquo;s Responsible Gaming framework is built upon the following three pillars:<br \/>\n2.1 Player Protection<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Preventing minors and vulnerable persons from accessing gambling services<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Robust age and identity verification<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Monitoring at-risk behavior and providing interventions<br \/>\n2.2 Fairness and Transparency<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Independent RNG and game audits<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Accurate, non-misleading marketing<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Clear information on rules, odds, and tools available to players<br \/>\n2.3 Prevention of Problem Gambling<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Behavioral monitoring systems<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Self-assessment tools<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Player-controlled limits<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Cooling-off and self-exclusion mechanisms<br \/>\nBETSSEN appoints a Responsible Gaming Officer (RGO) responsible for policy enforcement, monitoring outcomes, and submitting an effectiveness report to the executive team annually.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>3. Prevention of Underage Gambling<\/strong><br \/>\n3.1 Minimum Age<br \/>\nParticipation in any BETSSEN gaming service is strictly limited to individuals aged 18 years or older.<br \/>\n3.2 Age Verification (CGA Section 5)<br \/>\nBETSSEN applies a two-level age and identity verification process:<br \/>\n1.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Self-attested date of birth during registration<br \/>\n2.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Government-issued ID check prior to first withdrawal, and earlier if risk triggers occur<br \/>\nAccepted ID: passport, driver&rsquo;s license, national ID<br \/>\nSecondary verification (payment validation, selfie checks, database matches) may be used but never replace government-issued documents.<br \/>\n3.3 Minor Account Handling<br \/>\nIf a player is identified as a minor:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;The account is immediately closed<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Deposits refunded<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Winnings forfeited<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Reason for closure communicated clearly<br \/>\n3.4 Parental Control Tools<br \/>\nBETSSEN recommends the use of device-level and network-level filtering tools:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;BetBlocker<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;GamBlock<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Gamban<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>4. Player Information &amp; Accessibility<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN ensures complete transparency by providing easily accessible responsible gaming information.<br \/>\n4.1 Responsible Gaming Section (RG Section)<br \/>\nThe RG Section is:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Clearly visible and accessible from homepage &amp; footer<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Available in English and all target market languages<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Contains: deposit limits, loss limits, time limits, cooling-off, self-exclusion tools, self-assessment tests, support contacts<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Includes direct email\/chat access to Responsible Gaming support<br \/>\n4.2 Terms &amp; Conditions Inclusion<br \/>\nThe RG Section is explicitly referenced in the Terms &amp; Conditions.<br \/>\nT&amp;C is always one click away from the homepage.<br \/>\n4.3 Footer Requirements (Mandatory by CGA)<br \/>\nThe homepage footer displays:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Prohibition of underage gambling (18+)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;License holder name &amp; registered address<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Cura&ccedil;ao license number<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Statement of CGA regulatory oversight<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;CGA Digital Seal<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Dedicated RG link<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;At least one international and one local (when available) problem-gambling support resource<br \/>\n(Examples: GamCare, GambleAware, Gamblers Anonymous)<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>5. Self-Assessment Tools<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN provides players with self-evaluation tools to identify early signs of problem gambling.<br \/>\n5.1 Player Account History<br \/>\nPlayers may access a minimum six-month history of wagers and financial transactions directly via their account.<br \/>\nLonger periods are provided within 10 business days upon request.<br \/>\n5.2 Screening Tools<br \/>\nPlayers have access to:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Gamblers Anonymous 20 Questions<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;CAGE Questionnaire (Gambling Adaptation)<br \/>\n5.3 Interpretation Guidance<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;0 Yes &rarr; Low risk<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1 Yes &rarr; Moderate risk<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2+ Yes &rarr; High risk (intervention recommended)<br \/>\nPlayers identified at risk are encouraged to utilize BETSSEN&rsquo;s safer gambling tools or seek professional support.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>6. Behavioral Monitoring &amp; Interventions<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN actively monitors player behavior to detect harmful gambling patterns.<br \/>\n6.1 Key Monitoring Indicators<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Sudden spikes in deposits or wagering<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Repeated reversed withdrawals<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Excessive session duration<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Multiple failed payment attempts<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Bonus-seeking and agitation during support chats<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Rapid changes to RG tools<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Multiple accounts attempt (flagged immediately)<br \/>\n6.2 Player Profiling &amp; Documentation (CGA Requirement)<br \/>\nBETSSEN maintains a Player Account Management (PAM) profile containing:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Behavioral indicators<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Risk level<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Responsible gaming history<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Interventions taken<br \/>\nAll interactions are logged.<br \/>\n6.3 Intervention Protocol<br \/>\nDepending on risk level:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Communication recommending RG tools<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Mandatory deposit\/loss limits<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Temporary account suspension<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Permanent operator-initiated exclusion in severe cases<br \/>\nNo Responsible Gaming measure may ever be used to delay or prevent a legitimate withdrawal.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>7. Player-Controlled Restrictions<\/strong><br \/>\n7.1 Cooling-Off Period (Short-Term Breaks)<br \/>\nAvailable Durations<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;24 hours<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;7 days<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1 month<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;3 months<br \/>\nMandatory Options<br \/>\n1.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Duration<br \/>\n2.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Marketing Opt-Out<br \/>\nOptional but Supported (CGA-compliant)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Brand Selection: Current brand only OR all BETSSEN brands<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Vertical Selection:<br \/>\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;All gambling activity<br \/>\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Specific verticals (Casino \/ Slots Only \/ Sports Betting \/ Poker etc.)<br \/>\nEffects<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;All wagering disabled<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Withdrawals remain available<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Account stays accessible (non-gaming features only)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Changes can only make restriction more severe<br \/>\nReactivation<br \/>\nAutomatic after expiry; no player action required.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>7.2 Self-Exclusion (Long-Term)<\/strong><br \/>\nAvailable Durations<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1 year<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;3 years<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;5 years<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;10 years<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Lifetime<br \/>\nRules (CGA-Compliant)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Immediate effect upon activation<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Player cannot log in<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;All brands\/domains under BETSSEN included<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Automatic marketing opt-out<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;No wagers allowed<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Ante-post bets refunded according to civil law<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Poker tournaments in-progress may be completed<br \/>\nDuplicate Account Prevention<br \/>\nBETSSEN uses:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Device fingerprinting<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Payment method blacklisting<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;ID\/document match detection<br \/>\nto prevent excluded players from opening new accounts.<br \/>\nReactivation Process<br \/>\nAfter the exclusion period ends:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Player must request account reinstatement in writing (email or chat)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Operator must not initiate contact<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;A cooling-off review may be conducted before reactivation<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>8. Deposit, Loss, and Other Limits<\/strong><br \/>\n8.1 Deposit Limits<br \/>\nPlayers may set daily, weekly, or monthly limits.<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Limit increases take effect immediately<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Limit decreases require 24 hours cooling period<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Active wagers remain valid<br \/>\n8.2 Loss Limits \/ Time Limits \/ Wager Limits (Optional Tools)<br \/>\nAvailable to all players for improved bankroll management.<br \/>\n8.3 Exceptions Handling<br \/>\nIf a limit is applied while:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;A poker tournament is active: the session continues until completion<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;An ante-post bet is unresolved: wager remains, but no new wagers allowed<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>9. Staff Training &amp; Accountability<\/strong><br \/>\nAll customer-facing and decision-making staff&mdash;including Customer Support, VIP, Marketing, Fraud, and Payments&mdash;receive mandatory annual RG training covering:<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Recognizing distress or vulnerability<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Conducting sensitive risk conversations<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Recording interactions in PAM<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Escalation pathways<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;High-risk case handling<br \/>\nThe Responsible Gaming Officer ensures documentation and annual reporting to management.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>10. Marketing Compliance<\/strong><br \/>\nBETSSEN adheres to strict responsible marketing standards.<br \/>\n10.1 Prohibited Practices<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Targeting minors or vulnerable persons<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Suggesting gambling is a financial solution<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Misrepresenting odds or influence of skill<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Encouraging excessive play<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Using explicit, sexualized, or adult-themed content<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Associating gambling with alcohol, drugs, seduction, or prestige<br \/>\n10.2 Mandatory Inclusions<br \/>\nAll advertisements, digital or offline, must include:<br \/>\n&ldquo;Play Responsibly. 18+ Only.&rdquo;<br \/>\nplus a link to the Responsible Gaming Section.<br \/>\n10.3 Third-Party Controls<br \/>\nAffiliates, influencers, brand ambassadors, and marketing agencies must comply with BETSSEN&rsquo;s RG policy. Contracts include mandatory RG clauses.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>11. Enhanced Responsible Gambling Measures<\/strong><br \/>\nBased on risk profile and business model, BETSSEN may implement enhanced tools such as:<br \/>\n11.1 Reality Checks<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Session timers<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Real-time clocks<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Periodic pop-up reminders requiring confirmation<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Player-set custom alerts<br \/>\n11.2 Direct Player Interaction<br \/>\nAutomatic or manual pop-ups may be triggered when harmful patterns emerge.<br \/>\n11.3 Additional Safeguards<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Extended cooling-off options<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Temporary withdrawal blocks (player-controlled)<br \/>\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Recommended professional support channels<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/h4>\n","metaDescription":"","metaTitle":null,"metaUrl":null}}